00:00:00.334 --> 00:00:02.577
- He's a Hong Kong business magnate,

00:00:02.577 --> 00:00:03.410
investor,

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:04.331
and philanthropist.

00:00:04.331 --> 00:00:05.350
- According to Bloomberg,

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.414
he's the richest person in Asia.

00:00:07.414 --> 00:00:08.924
He was listed by Forbes

00:00:08.924 --> 00:00:09.919
of having a fortune

00:00:09.919 --> 00:00:12.176
of over $34 billion.

00:00:12.176 --> 00:00:13.254
- He's Li Ka Shing,

00:00:13.254 --> 00:00:16.837
and here are his top
ten rules for success.

00:00:19.071 --> 00:00:22.238
(speaking in Chinese)

00:03:04.433 --> 00:03:07.683
(soft classical music)

00:09:26.596 --> 00:09:29.679
(soft Chinese music)

00:09:49.852 --> 00:09:51.923
- Thank you so much for watching us.

00:09:51.923 --> 00:09:53.037
We made this video because

00:09:53.037 --> 00:09:54.808
Wei Yung asked us to.

00:09:54.808 --> 00:09:56.548
If you'd like to see someone else

00:09:56.548 --> 00:09:57.541
to be profiled,

00:09:57.541 --> 00:09:58.607
